{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜戴耳機及掏耳注意\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-I-EARPHONE-261123.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】平時忍不住掏耳，或者用入耳式耳機，有機會刺激到外耳道皮膚，造成角質皮屑增生。這些皮屑如果「走錯地方」，跑到中耳腔不斷堆積，便有機會導致中耳炎，甚至形成膽脂瘤。今集我們請來香港耳鼻喉科醫學院教育委員會主任鍾駿傑，講解日常生活有何注意，以免出現這個情況，萬一有膽脂瘤又要怎樣治療。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:55:15.888864+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T14:09:02.641115+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:48.774273+00:00","content_hash":"d3316918fa702c20ab551adefa1992e5a8c57ad69efc7fb20d6412eeb4431d7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}